      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُنِاقٌ</span></b>  [<i>Quinsy;</i>] <i>a certain disease which pre
vents the passage of the breath to the lungs and
heart;</i> (K;) as also [↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُنَاقَةٌ</span></b>  thus in modern
